WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.180
In order for the power of 
darkness to control the world,

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:20.270
we need the power of the seven stones.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.230
My eternal life will be complete 
with the power of the stones.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.960
We already have the seven stones.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.640
We just need to get the 
power of the stones back.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.120
So it won't take long.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:39.170
The power of the stones 
is enormously powerful.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.150
Even someone from the Field of Light

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:44.040
cannot control the power that 
comes from the power of light.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:48.240
The power of light needs 
the container to hold it.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.470
You mustn't lose the container.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:54.850
I know. Just leave it to this Belzay...

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.810
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.640
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:07.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.880
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.750
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:19.560
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:26.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.070
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:32.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.840
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:39.410
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:51.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:52.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.330
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:58.130
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.030
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:05.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.780
Stop goofing off, and get 
back to work zakenna!

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:45.910
But Master Belzay told me to keep 
an eye on the keeper zakenna.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.260
Then don't mess up the place zakenna!

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.470
Hey!

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.450
What zakenna?

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.680
Are you the only ones here in the house now?

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.150
That's right. So what about it zakenna?

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:03.780
In that case, I'm thirsty, so can 
you bring me a glass of water?

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.800
Can you bring it? Can you bring it?

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:09.070
All right zakenna.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:16.330
Why are you doing his bidding zakenna?

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.510
That hurt!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.340
What fools!

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.560
Did you say something zakenna?

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.530
What fools! What fools!

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:30.530
Be quiet!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:44.400
"REACH FOR FREEDOM!
 STONE KEEPER'S DESPERATE GREAT ESCAPE"

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.790
Let's see...

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:52.680
This is the 15th, so the next 
one is this one, isn't it?

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.600
What are you doing popo?

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.100
It's our science homework.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.760
We're checking the weather 
charts for the past month.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.700
What's a weather chart popo?

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.830
A weather chart is the weather 
converted into symbols.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.750
I was really worried that Hasekura-kun 
found out our Pretty Cure identity,

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.730
but he seemed to have gotten the 
strangest idea into his head,

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.550
so we don't have to worry.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:25.830
But to think that Hasekura-kun's ideal is 
Cure Black is really complicated for me.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.090
Never mind!

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:33.360
The dark warriors don't seem to realize

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:36.970
that the power of the stones 
reside inside Pollun yet...

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.720
Nagisa!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.680
Where are you cutting?

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:46.540
I'm sorry!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.730
Look at the beautiful flowers mipo!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.290
What kind of flower is it mepo?

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.800
Daffodils growing out of season.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:59.890
I'll admit that they're beautiful, but 
Mipple's hundreds of times more beautiful mepo.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:03.190
Mepple! What are you saying?

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:05.220
Mipple!

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.180
Popo!

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:09.090
Mepple!

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:12.110
Carry me popo! Carry me popo!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:14.310
Stop it mepo!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:17.270
I'm saying something important 
to Mipple right now mepo.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:22.130
Carry me popo! Carry me popo!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.100
There he goes again.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.260
Carry me popo! Carry me popo!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:31.090
Pollun's always like this mepo!

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.610
He's such a brat mepo!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.670
Mepple! You don't have to say that mipo!

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:37.420
Mipple!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.020
Pollun...? I'll carry you mipo.

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:44.160
I'm happy popo!

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.770
Carry me popo! Carry me popo!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:51.950
Mipo!

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:56.440
I don't think you should 
spoil him like that mepo.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:14.470
Puri puri puri puri puri puri!

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:18.330
Mepple... Stop being so stubborn, 
and make up with Mipple.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.350
Why do I have to make up with her mepo?

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:24.420
I don't think what you said is wrong...

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.670
That's right mepo.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:29.890
But it's no use getting so 
worked up like that, is it?

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.020
I'm not worked up mepo!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.770
Why don't you make up with Mepple, Mipple?

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.870
Just let him be mipo!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.920
I don't think he should have 
talked to Pollun like that mipo.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:48.230
He should be more careful 
of what he says mipo.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:49.980
The flowers popo...

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.510
What happened all of a sudden?

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.580
Is it about the article you saw earlier?

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.680
Either clean the place or eat your bread!

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.460
Do one or the other zakenna.

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:20.990
Then, I'll eat my bread zakenna.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.360
If you keep goofing off...

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.560
I'm going to tell Master 
Belzay on you zakenna!

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:33.410
There are only those two 
fools inside the place now.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.530
Which means... I might be able to escape now.

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.810
I have it!

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:55.950
Don't spill the food zakenna.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.610
Over here, too zakenna.

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:07.050
There's more over here again zakenna.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:08.830
Over here again zakenna.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:10.150
Over here zakenna.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.750
Zakenna!

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.630
Zakenna...

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:17.330
Don't be such a slowpoke!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.190
Don't be such a slowpoke! 
Don't be such a slowpoke!

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.260
What!

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.810
Teach this cockatoo a lesson zakenna!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:29.110
You shouldn't bad-mouth others zakenna!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:41.210
What are you doing zakenna?

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.760
Hey! Come back zakenna!

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:53.450
I won't let you get away zakenna!

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.940
Where? Where is he zakenna?

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:06.750
On your shoulder zakenna!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.580
Farewell, you two comedians!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.190
Come back zakenna!

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.320
Hurry, and go after him zakenna!

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.540
Zakenna!

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:36.280
I did it! I'm out of that mansion!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:43.100
Go after him! Go after him! Go after him!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.910
Master Belzay...

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.970
A lot happened, and to 
get right to the point...

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.340
You let him escape...?

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.340
I'm so sorry zakenna!

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:55.910
What were you doing anyway?

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:59.570
Clumsy fools...

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.710
Clumsy fools!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:09.350
No use crying over spilled milk...

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.760
Hurry, and get him back!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:14.020
Zakenna!

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.090
It's no use trying to run away...

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:21.350
Your short-lived freedom will only 
result in even bigger despair.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.430
It's no use...

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:00.270
No matter where I go, 
I'm still in the forest.

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:02.200
Where in the world is the way out?

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.480
Pollun?

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:13.720
Pollun!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.020
That voice...?

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.480
It's Stone Keeper mipo!

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.970
It's Stone Keeper popo!

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.970
I felt your presence, so I 
called out to you, Pollun.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.330
Hurry, and rescue me!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.610
Where are you now mepo?

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:27.660
We're coming right away mepo.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.980
Being able to communicate 
with Stone Keeper...

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:31.820
Pollun... you're awesome mipo!

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:34.070
It's not that Pollun's awesome...

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:37.770
I'm sure it's just that Stone Keeper is out 
of range of the power of darkness mepo.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.250
You don't have to lash out at me mipo!

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:40.820
But...

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:42.310
That's enough!

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:44.960
This is no time to be fighting, is it?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.430
Where are you now?

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.630
I escaped from the mansion, 
and I'm in the forest now.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:52.710
Which forest?

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:53.830
I don't know.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:56.540
Isn't there some kind of 
landmark around there?

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.900
Can't you see anything?

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:00.300
Trees.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:07.800
There's nothing but forest around 
me, and nothing that stand out.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:14.970
I finally escaped, but at this 
rate, it's all for nothing.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.250
Wait... wait a minute!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.020
There are flowers...

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:21.350
Flowers are in bloom!

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:22.560
Flowers?

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:35.740
What beautiful flowers!

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.580
There are lots and lots of flowers.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:42.200
But that doesn't tell us much...

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.410
It's this popo... This flower popo.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.610
This is the article we just saw...

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:51.040
Then the flowers Stone Keeper mentioned is...

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.720
Dandelions!

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:56.660
Dandelions normally only bloom in the spring,

00:12:56.660 --> 00:13:02.590
but because of a hot springs, these 
flowers bloom in the fall, too.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:10.260
Where did he go zakenna?

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:14.040
We have to hurry, and find him before 
we get yelled at again zakenna.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.730
Zakenna!

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:21.190
There aren't that many forests where 
dandelions are blooming at this time of year.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.640
It has to be that forest they wrote 
about in that article, doesn't it?

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.110
I found him zakenna!

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:34.520
I won't let you get away again zakenna!

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.210
I can feel Stone Keeper's presence popo!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.020
Which way?

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:45.060
This way popo!

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.120
Let's go!

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:57.170
You may as well give up zakenna.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:59.850
Stone Keeper popo!

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.060
Stone Keeper!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.330
Who are you anyway zakenna?

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:06.960
Zakenna!

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:10.500
Don't tell me you're part 
of that group of three?

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:14.870
So what if we are zakenna?

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:26.720
I feel a really sinister presence mepo!

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.690
This forest is dangerous.

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:29.900
We'd better get out of here fast.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:37.020
Stone Keeper!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.290
Stone Keeper!

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.520
Popo!

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.710
Let me go popo! Let me go popo!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.370
Let me go popo!

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:46.210
Pollun!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:57.170
You're...!

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.800
Master Belzay!

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:03.500
Too bad. I can't let you have the keeper.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.310
He caught Pollun, too mipo!

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:07.590
This is bad mepo!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.780
Nagisa! Honoka! Transform mepo.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:10.970
Honoka...

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:20.170
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.670
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.350
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.170
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:06.580
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.010
Go back to where you came from!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:13.490
I never expected to run into you two here...

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.980
How well things work out in this world...

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:29.110
Now that you know about this forest, we 
can't stay in this forest any longer.

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:33.000
It's okay... We just have to 
move the mansion somewhere else.

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:35.140
Let Stone Keeper and Pollun go.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.210
Right now!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:41.310
But if I defeat you two here, there 
won't be any need to move, will there?

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:56.970
He really...

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.790
...has awesome power mepo!

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.390
We're just getting started!

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:01.870
We won't be defeated!

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:10.440
He's strong mepo!

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:14.910
Until I find out where the power of 
the stones is, I'll let you live.

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:16.590
White!

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.090
Black Thunder!

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:22.960
White Thunder!

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:31.520
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.370
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:38.880
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:09.410
All you need is resolve and fighting spirit!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.400
The Pretty Cure Marble Screw...

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:15.110
He diffused it mepo!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.790
On top of that, in his condition...

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.110
...he can't use that technique.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.620
You're driven into a corner, aren't you?

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:25.530
Put me down popo... Let me go popo...

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:27.550
Pollun!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:30.630
Popo...

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.220
Pollun...

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.620
Pollun...

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:38.920
Let Pollun down...

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:40.570
Pollun!

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.100
Untie me popo...

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.970
Put me down popo...

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:51.970
Enough already mepo!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.450
I'm the only one who knows where 
the power of the stones is mepo!

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:56.870
Mepple...

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:59.910
I'll tell you, so let those two down mepo!

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:07.220
Mepple!

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:08.930
Where is the power of the stones?

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:12.020
If you let those two go, I'll tell you mepo.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:16.600
Let them go...? Do you 
think I'll fall for that?

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:20.000
If you let them go, I'll 
really tell you mepo!

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:22.280
You'd better tell me now, or...

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.230
Black!

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:27.210
Hurry, and tell me before I destroy you both.

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.610
Mepple...

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:31.800
Tell me...

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:41.760
Don't pick on Mepple popo!

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:55.620
Accept the power of light popo!

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.950
If you want to resolve and fighting spirit...

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:17.930
We'll show you!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:35.880
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:39.320
And fight your way toward the future!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:43.190
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:00.110
Damn!

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:29.320
